{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/8936cd4ce37ddb1947df6027d4614beb.avif?t=1768467822\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An Eastern hopping corpse that needs your blood to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/2bd87d1978cdc337ed298d99d4057f61.avif?t=1768467822\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A giant bug that\u2019s always calm and good at plotting, plus setting traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/9d2f02387a0b32075e31539b7cd1c385.avif?t=1768467822\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everyone, please add this to your wishlist and support this monster-themed action-adventure epic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everyone, please add this to your wishlist and support this monster-themed action-adventure epic!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2193\u2193There are even bigger monsters here\u2014<strong>like a spaceship made of flesh. It\u2019ll ask you to kill her.</strong>\u2193\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/3d82cb3b5cd8a42a792522bd11dfe6cb.avif?t=1768467822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/3d82cb3b5cd8a42a792522bd11dfe6cb.webp?t=1768467822 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you don\u2019t, she\u2019ll keep eating pretty girls~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/b10492102295810cbb89951e03c7b251.avif?t=1768467822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/b10492102295810cbb89951e03c7b251.webp?t=1768467822 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tons of characters build this story\u2014from a living city to an other-dimensional rainforest, even spanning hundreds of millions of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/bf9a83980c2a89e8fb8a62df07844ba0.avif?t=1768467822\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras_big/bf9a83980c2a89e8fb8a62df07844ba0.avif?t=1768467822 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/aaea04ae85cad1bcd4949f5473654d2d.avif?t=1768467822\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It started with a kiss, started with the breakdown of a beloved one, and is filled with intense battles.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the end, the story will reach a philosophical place, and show you a romantic, warm tale that breaks through dimension walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Devs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a narrative-driven game studio, creators of the indie game <i>GhostFeed</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by epic stories like <i>Fate/stay night</i> and <i>Steins;Gate</i>, and deeply moved by <i>EVA</i>'s visual storytelling, we craft immersive worlds in this spirit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was developed using the Wansei Xingchen Editor, boosting our workflow efficiency. We hope you enjoy this new chapter.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u53e6\u4e00\u53ea\u773c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/055a09cf1182670c9348902e10f246f94d90885c.jpg"},{"name":"\u627e\u56de\u624b\u5566","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/febad6ef111a6b77a8a87e395af9a717c3d90443.jpg"},{"name":"\u80c3\u90e8\u4e0d\u9002","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/dffaa19e649080ac155936068fad8265c5279337.jpg"},{"name":"\u7ec6\u80de\u7834\u788e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/960b720888f433b5d7a3506e820dbd181d27c453.jpg"},{"name":"\u73b0\u5b9e\u89e3\u79bb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/eb64df7cbc24a2a4dc9f9b76b571b89e189f0af3.jpg"},{"name":"\u6253\u5f00\u4f60\u7684KEY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/e4564cb3c288440ce701f6c4bb6bddda0bb4d03b.jpg"},{"name":"\u8df3\u52a8\u5fc3\u810f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/2e434f959bde151614734ca9408a7055f4e88c3f.jpg"},{"name":"\u8718\u86db\u5de2\u57ce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/134d80e55d9de0f7e7de137b5ab0204272755c95.jpg"},{"name":"\u7f38\u4e2d\u4e4b\u8111","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668550/e61da82c5666f92f08f6789747e115adf3f18b5a.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://st